sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W1 as worker 1: set state to claimed if pending
    participant W2 as worker 2: set state to claimed if pending
    participant R as regolith

    W1->>R: get_parts(d, state): pending
    W2->>R: get_parts(d, state): pending
    W1->>R: merge(d, state claimed by 1)
    W2->>R: merge(d, state claimed by 2)
    W1->>R: commit
    R-->>W1: committed: worker 1 wins the claim
    W2->>R: commit
    Note over R: a newer operand touches state, a part worker 2 read
    R-->>W2: Conflict: mine ReadParts, theirs Merge
    W2->>R: transact re-runs with the reason
    W2->>R: get_parts(d, state): claimed
    Note over W2: business logic: the filter no longer matches, report not claimed
